window.products.push({"id":919035,"name":"Wheatgrass Juicer Machines, KEDEMAS Cold Press Masticating Juicers for Home, Easy to Clean and Quiet Motor, Reverse Function, Slow Juicers Maker with ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":84.79,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Ytm1S-VLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🍎Tasty Enough to Drink🍎 The slow juicers machine helps extract the maximum nutrients from the vegetables, fruits and leafy greens. Due to the slow and gentle process, KEDEMAS masticating juicer can produce a higher quality of juice from fruits and veggies that’s thick and less foamy and has a more intense flavor. 🥬Easy to Clean🥬 KEDEMAS cold press juicer maker featuring safety lock design, takes no effort to assemble and disasssemble. With the help of equipped cleaning brush, you can clean the detachable parts in few minutes. In addition, the parts can be safely cleaned in your dishwasher. The reverse function is a bonus to avoid stuck. 🥕Richer Nutrient🥕 The Slow masticating juicer can perfectly separate juice and pulp, extracting higher-purity juice and preserving higher nutritional value. The auger spins at a very slow speed of 80 RPM and produce higher juice yield with dry pulp. Lower speed means no heat build-up and less oxidation,less foaming or clogging, 90% more nutrition growth, remain much more enzymes, vitamins, minerals and trace minerals. 🍒Quiet Motor🍒 The juicers grind to extract more juice and fiber at less than 60 decibels, the quiet operation won’t disturb your family and neighbour, no complain about noise. Specially in the early mornings, your baby is sleeping. Completely enjoy a comfortable moment of making juice. 🥦Juicer for Fruits and Vegetables🥦 KEDEMAS juicer machine can extract all types of fruits and veggies,including celery, spinach, ginger, wheatgrass, kale, pine needles, cabbage, carrot, apple and more. KEDEMAS provides a worry-free 12 months guarantee and lifetime parts replacement. For any questions, please don’t hesitate to contact us directly and get a solution within 24hs. 🍉Juicer with cleaning brush🍉 This juicer comes with a specially-designed brush for cleaning the hard-to-reach areas of the juicing screen, ensuring a thorough clean every time. 🍐Versatile Juicer Machine🍐 KEDEMAS slow juicers can handle a wide variety of fruits and vegetables, including leafy greens, wheatgrass, and even harder items like beets and carrots. This allows for more creative recipes and greater variety in juice. 🍊Juicer Maker with Reverse function🍊 If you encounter any clogs or jams, simply activate the reverse function to clear them and keep your juicing process running smoothly. 🥝Slow Juicer with Compact design🥝 This cold press juicer is designed to fit easily on your kitchen counter, without taking up too much space. Its sleek, modern look also means it will blend in with any kitchen decoration. 💪Health Benefits💪 Drinking fresh juices is a great way to increase your intake of vitamins, minerals, and nutrients, and this juicer makes it easy to start your juicing life.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Ytm1S-VLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KEDEMAS","source_asin":"B09Y8VF8R1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-919035","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09Y8VF8R1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09Y8VF8R1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
