window.products.push({"id":919087,"name":"Cardinal Tile, Cardinal Wall Plaque, Cardinal Trivet","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41sPXCErVyL._AC_.jpg","description":"HAND PAINTED CARDINAL TILE, WALL PLAQUE, TRIVET  Makers of fine, hand painted art tile for the U.S. Capitol Building, major museums, historical societies, zoos, national parks and many fine shops nationwide. All our tiles are available as trivets, wall plaques, or for permanent installations. Size: 6\" x 6\"  Hand Painted Decorative Art Tiles, Ceramic Wall Plaques and Ceramic Trivets Since 1972. Each comes with a protective backing for use as a heat resistant trivet, and the secure hanger allows their use as easy to hang wall plaques.   OR - order them WITHOUT the backing and hanger for permanent installations as kitchen backsplash tiles, bathroom tile, fireplace surround tile, countertop tile and more. For permanent installations, our tiles are compatible with Daltile and American Olean. As members of The League of New Hampshire Craftsman and New Hampshire Made, your total satisfaction is ABSOLUTELY GUARANTEED!!   Easy Decorating with Hand Painted Tile:   Many people think, that to decorate with tile requires a permanent installation. This couldn’t be further from the truth. Besheer Art Tile offers over 300 hand painted tile designs and all are available with a complimentary secure hanger and backing. This allows our tiles to simply be hung on any wall, in any room, using very small brads. In this way, decorative groupings can be created around a particular theme without having to permanently install the tiles. It becomes a stunning and exquisite addition to any room in your home. For example, you can hang a collection of song bird tiles on the walls in a kitchen and it will set the mood for the entire room.   At Besheer Art Tile we use \"Old World Techniques\", hand paint each tile and kiln fire it to 2000 degrees. The porcelain enamels are colorful, vibrant, and will never wash or fade away. NO decals or overlays are used. MADE IN THE U.S.A.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41sPXCErVyL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Besheer Art Tile","source_asin":"B000O8S7X0","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-919087","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000O8S7X0","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000O8S7X0","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
