window.products.push({"id":919260,"name":"Stainless Steel Measuring Cups and Spoons Set of 16-7 Cup & 7 Spoon + Conversion Chart & Leveler - Kitchen Measuring Spoons and Cups - Dry Measure Cup","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":32.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81xxxKK66nL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"⭐ ALL SIZES EVERY KITCHEN NEEDS! Unlike other stainless steel metal measuring cups and spoons sets that only have 12 pieces, our set offers 16 pieces with a 7 piece dry metal measuring cup set that has sizes from 1 cup down to an 8th cup (1 cup, ¾ cup, ⅔ cup, ½ cup, ⅓ cup, ¼ cup, ⅛ cup), as well as 7 metal measuring spoons from 1 tablespoon to an 8th teaspoon (1 Tbsp, ½ Tbsp, 1 tsp, ¾ tsp, ½ tsp, ¼ tsp and ⅛ tsp) and a magnetic conversion chart and a leveler spoon. 💯 EASY TO READ MEASUREMENTS! Our measurements are stamped right into the metal so they will never wear off. Each mesururing cup also has outside markings for a smaller measurement size that is visible on the inside. It‘s time to replace your old plastic cup & spoon measure set where the writings rub off. Makes a great gift for every baking lover! 💪 DESIGNED TO LAST A LIFETIME! The metric measuring cups and spoons are all made out of one piece of metal so the handles will never bend or break off. They are made out of the highest quality & heavy duty 18/8 (304) stainless steel so they‘re super easy to clean - just put them into the dishwasher. Makes a great and useful white elephant gift for adults. 💡 INCLUDES ALL ODD SIZES + BONUS MAGNETIC CONVERSION CHART & LEVELER SPOON! Our set includes all additional & odd sizes like the rare 2/3, ¾ & 1/8 baking measuring cups stainless steel and also the ½ & ¾ measuring spoon. We also included as a bonus a magnetic conversion chart and a leveler spoon, so this measuring spoons and cups set has exactly everything that you are looking for. 🎁 A GREAT GIFT THAT IS BACKED BY A 3-YEAR WARRANTY! Our kitchen food accessories metric measuring tools make an ideal present for weddings, a wedding shower or housewarming parties, or put the best set on your own bridal or couples registry","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81xxxKK66nL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KPKitchen","source_asin":"B06W5FQJQX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-919260","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B06W5FQJQX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B06W5FQJQX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
