window.products.push({"id":919269,"name":"Automatic Soap Dispenser Touchless,400ml Touchless Liquid Soap Dispenser,Hands-Free Dish Soap Dispenser, Waterproof Sensor, Auto Liquid Soap Dispenser","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51NJm7lQn2L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"[14oz/400ml]: Automatic Soap Dispenser, 2-4 inches (5-10cm) are an excellent scope. Liquid flows from automatic soap dispensers when you put your hands in front for 1-2s.Blue light is emitted during water flowing. [Free from Installation]: Automatic soap dispenser is suitable for kitchen, bathroom, hotels and hospitals. No installation required. [IP65 Life Waterproof Base]: Made from ABS, touchless soap dispenser is IP65 waterproof, which can protect electric board against liquid soap or water. Keep in place and won’t move. Do not touch water or immerse in water to prolong its service life. No incline or invert. [Fashionable Design & Touchless]: Touchless soap dispenser works well in kitchens, bathrooms, hotels, hospitals. Also decorate your bathroom sink well just as an artwork. Draw 1-1.5ML per time. If you need more, please hold hands and wait for 1.5-2s, then it will draw again. [High-sensitivity Sensor]: Upgraded automatic soap dispenser with built-in anti-infrared interference and PIR sensor testing technology ensures longer working life and shows higher sensitivity. Just pull down the bottom holder to find the battery box and 4 AAA batteries are needed (not included). Rechargeable batteries can also be used. Notes: 1.Try this soap dispenser 2-3 times to ensure that the straw is filled with soap; 2.Check “+” and “-“ between battery and touchless soap dispenser to ensure a proper installation; 3.Do not use thicker soap, Laundry liquid, shower gel, shampoo, detergent, etc.liquid; 4.Avoid sun exposure, which may lead to induction and further bring liquid flow; 5.Avoid to wash under tap or immerse in water, and do not make it inclined or inverted. [After-sales]: We offer you 12-month warranty, so don’t hesitate to contact us for any question. We will try our best to help you solve all of them!Thanks for your trust!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51NJm7lQn2L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Beuras","source_asin":"B0B6YT62GJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-919269","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B6YT62GJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B6YT62GJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
