window.products.push({"id":919295,"name":"RFAQK 133PCs Round Cake Pans Sets for Baking-Nonstick 8 Inch Cake Pan Set of 3 with Baking Supplies,Parchment Paper,Muffin Liner,Cake Leveler,Icing Ti","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":23.49,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81T9RqiUhzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🌟 Set Includes – 8 inches round baking pans (3x), pre-cut parchment paper inserts (35 pcs), cupcake paper liners (60x), disposable piping bags (20x), numbered icing tips (8x), icing spread combs (3x), stainless steel cake leveler (12.6 inches) with adjustable scale, coupler, icing spatula, cake board so as to help you Bake, Level, and Decorate cakes. 🍲 Premium Quality – Our round cake pans are made of non-toxic carbon steel (PTFE, PFOA, BPA free) so every item you bake is 100% safe for consumption. The non-stick coating does not scrape off (when mistakenly scratched with a metal substance) which means these pans will stand the test of time for years to come. They are perfectly compatible for use inside air fryer, instant pot, conventional and toaster ovens bearing heat up to 450ºF without warping. 💯 Non-Stick – The non-stick coating is incorporated inside, not sprayed on. This means (unlike others) the non-stick layer on our black cake pan will not damage or rust even when making bakery products with a less pH range. Though our cake pans are dishwasher safe, we still recommend gentle hand washing for longevity. 🔰 Additional Components – This baking pans set includes extra components for help with cake decorating. There’s a stainless steel cake leveler with adjustable wire for evenly slicing cakes, piping nozzles with piping bags for cupcake decoration, an icing spatula for either spreading frosting on cake or freeing its sides when releasing from the pan, patterned cupcake liners, parchment papers with lift tabs, and a cake board for placing cakes. 🎖 Customer Satisfaction – Our customers set the standards, RFAQK meets them via the provision of high-quality cake pans ideal for baking layered-cakes, pizzas, quiches, ice-cream cakes, and lasagnas. Have any problems with your purchase? Feel free to contact us for a no-questions-asked replacement or refund.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81T9RqiUhzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"RFAQK","source_asin":"B0BXXS8215","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-919295","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BXXS8215","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BXXS8215","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
