window.products.push({"id":919421,"name":"KYONANO Tamping Mat, Tamper Mat Food-Safe Silicone Espresso Mat Heavy-Duty Luxury High-Grip Espresso Tamping Mat Tamper Mat for Espresso Machine Baris","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71HoLSRV3rL._AC_SL1493_.jpg","description":"☕STYLISH TAMPING MAT - Unlike other tamper mats,KYONANO Espresso Tamping Mat is made with thick prongs, no need to worry for cracking, slipping. It can better safely support Tamper and cups, also keep bars and tables clean without the hassle of handling mixed stains, and give your countertop a stylish and modern kitchen counter look. Slightly raised sides prevent spillage of any coffee grinds. Dimension: 11.8 × 5.9 inches ☕100% FOOD GRADE SILICONE - We concerned about customer’s health by using the food-grade silicone rather than cheap rubber, our mat can come in direct contact with food, utensils, or glasses without worries! It’s completely safe, odorless, soft with high flexibility and durability, and non-slip. 🍺 Perfect Espresso Accessories & Multipurpose: The espresso tamping mat is suitable for commercial or domestic. Professional barista essential tamper mat. Non-slip material of tamper mat keeps your espresso Tamper, coffee mugs, glasses, and dishware in place. It can also be used in various places, including kitchen, living room, barber shops, bars, dining tables, restaurants.Using our handy product will keep your place clean and tidy. 🍺Easy to Clean: Our coffee tamping mat is highly flexible and durable, rolls up for easy storage. Clean with running water or simply toss it in the dishwasher. 💯100% SATISFACTORY WARRANTY: if our ESPRESSO SILICONE TAMPER MAT did not work well, please contact KYONANO for exchange, refund, or return.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71HoLSRV3rL._AC_SL1493_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KYONANO","source_asin":"B08XBK68PS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-919421","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08XBK68PS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08XBK68PS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":919422,"name":"Stainless Steel Ice Cubes Set of 8 with Plastic Storage Box Tongs Gift Set By Scotch Rocks","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81hOJ5JRI+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Whether there's just one special someone visiting for the evening or a whole party gathering for the night, a host or hostess wants to make the best possible impression with every cocktail or beverage served. The Scotch Rocks Silver Edition Gift Set provides all of the essentials for stylish serving and is a great hostess gift, housewarming gift, Father's Day gift, Mother's Day gift or present for any other occasion.  The Scotch Rocks Silver Edition Gift Set is a serving set that includes a total of eight ice cube replacements and serving tongs for placing them in glasses. The reusable ice cubes are constructed out of high quality stainless steel and filled with a food-grade, nontoxic chilling liquid that reaches optimal temperature after just 4 hours in the freezer.  Drop two to three of the stainless steel ice cubes in a glass, and whatever's inside will be at the perfect sipping temperature in no time. The 1-inch metal ice cubes can even cool down hot coffee to create chilled dessert drinks or make freshly hot-brewed ice tea ready to sip in a hurry. With their sleek design, these ice cubes look attractive in any glass, and they will never dilute drinks the way that frozen water ice cubes can. Plus, stainless steel won't alter the taste of drinks, stain or take on the flavors or scents of beverages.  The tongs included in the Scotch Rocks Silver Edition Gift Set are of the finest possible quality. Comfortable to wield, the tongs grip the cubes firmly, so you can drop them in the glass with ease. A close-able, reusable storage and freezing tray is also provided with the gift.  Treat someone special to a set that will have them serving wonderfully flavored drinks in the utmost of style or complete your bar set with the highest quality ice cube alternatives on Amazon! Order the Scotch Rocks Silver Edition Gift Set today.  Everything arrives in a gift box ready for wrapping, simplifying gift-giving.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81hOJ5JRI+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Scotch Rocks","source_asin":"B00BDN9KJK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-919422","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00BDN9KJK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00BDN9KJK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
