window.products.push({"id":919621,"name":"MUMUXI Wine Bottle Lights with Cork Switch [10 Pack] | Easy-to-Use 3.3ft 20 LED Bottle Lights | Universal Size Cork Lights for Wine Bottles Liquor Bot","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81g0PKbYLML._AC_SL1480_.jpg","description":"【Fuss-free and Foolproof】Use LED bottle lights to make your home, garden, bedroom or bathroom look warm and inviting with ease. Forget worrying about drilling holes or fiddling with hard-to-reach on/off switches. Plus, its battery-powered design means you’ll be free from the constraints of plug socket locations. 【Bottle Lights With High-Quality LEDs】Light up a room with 20 bright, luminescent LEDs per string (3.3ft). Get yours in a range of colors to transform any room into a space you’ll want to invite friends and family. 【Sturdy and Waterproof】Rain? Thunderstorms? Fierce wind? Not a problem with insulated, weatherproof copper wire designed to withstand the elements and rigors of regular use. Exactly what you want for garden parties, Halloween lights, weddings or home decoration. 【Low Energy Usage】Keep the energy bill to a minimum with low voltage LEDs that won’t burn out with regular use or overheat in sunny weather. And for families with kids? These bottle lights with cork switch are completely safe to be handled, even when turned on. 【Batteries Included】Enjoy the convenience of 3 pre-installed batteries and the peace-of-mind that comes with 30 free replacements (worth $5). With each fresh set lasting 48 hours, these battery operated wine bottle lights will spare you from worrying about plunging your family and friends into sudden darkness.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81g0PKbYLML._AC_SL1480_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MUMUXI","source_asin":"B07VPCHQ1X","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-919621","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07VPCHQ1X","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07VPCHQ1X","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":919622,"name":"Personalized Poetry Gift \"Marriage Takes Three\" on Wedding Vows Background","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Kf2EFv33L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"The poem on the art background is as follows: Couples Name Married on the #day of Month, Year Marriage Takes Three It’s not enough just two you see, to complete His plan there must be three. As Husband and Wife you complete your love, with sacred vows and the Lord above. If together you’ll both kneel and pray, with sincere hearts as you end each day, And in all you do, if you put Him first, He’ll meet your needs and quench your thirst. It’s not enough, just two you see… to complete His plan, it takes all three. Love each other… And take delight in honoring each other. Romans 12:10","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Kf2EFv33L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Personalized Creations","source_asin":"B00EEQ220W","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-919622","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00EEQ220W","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00EEQ220W","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
