window.products.push({"id":919914,"name":"Waterproof Mattress Protector Full Size, Bamboo Mattress Protector 3D Air Fabric Cooling Breathable Mattress Pad, Noiseless Mattress Cover, Fit 18 inc","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Bc+Ff0a+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"PROTECT YOUR MATTRESS: The waterproof mattress protector is made of TPU backing, which can perfectly defend for your valuable mattress against all kinds of liquids, including urine, perspiration, and accidental spills. A mattress protector is perfect for children, pets, or any other daily accidents. You never need to worry about getting your mattress wet or about the stain anymore. BREATHABLE BAMBOO FABRIC: Our full mattress protector is made of 30% bamboo fabric and 70% polyester. The TPU waterproof barrier sandwich does not add extra heat and allows airflow to pass through, which will make this mattress protector extremely breathable. With air permeability up to 20%, it can protect you from night sweats. DEEP POCKET DESIGN FIT BETTER: This full size mattress protector measures 54\" x 75\", and features a smooth skirt design that ensures it fits on mattresses of up to 18 \"deep. The elastic band makes it easy to stretch and fit the base of the mattress, which works like a fitted sheet to wrap right around your mattress. EXTRA PEACEFUL SLEEP: The surface of the full mattress cover is soft and comfortable, which ensures a restful sleep without the crinkling sound or plasticky feel of other sheets as you move across the bed. You'd think it is just a regular fitted sheet that just happens to act as a force-field around your mattress. MACHINE WASHABLE: Ozesheep mattress protector will not cause deformation with repeated washing and drying. Throwing this mattress protector in the wash with ease, you can get that fresh sheet feeling from the top to the bottom. Buy now and enjoy a 10-year warranty!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Bc+Ff0a+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ozesheep","source_asin":"B0B889NS7K","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-919914","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B889NS7K","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B889NS7K","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":919915,"name":"Giantex 22\"x60\" Semi-Shut Roller Blind Sunscreen Sun Shade Window Bedroom (22\"x60\", Beige)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51UiVr07aHL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"DESCRIPTION: This is our brand new 22\"x60\" Semi-shut Roller Blind which can block some dazzling light and leave soft light in the room. It would be your good choice to have a good relaxing in the blind. There are brown, white, beige and gray, totally 4 colors for choosing. Don't hesitate to buy one now! INSIDE MOUNT MEASUREMENT: Step 1.Measure the inside frame height at three locations- the top, middle, and bottom. Record the smallest of the 3 measurements and use that number deduct 1/4inch as your inside height when ordering. Step 2. Measure the width at 3 locations-the left, middle, and right side. Record the smallest of the 3 measurements and use the number as your inside width when ordering. OUTSIDE MOUNT MEASUREMENT: Step 1. Measure the outside frame width adding 6-10 inch to be the outside mount width. Step 2. Measure the outside frame length adding 5-10 inch to be the outside mount length. The overlap it recommended to allow appropriate coverage and avoid any light gaps. DESCRIPTION: This is our brand new 22\"x60\" Semi-shut Roller Blind which can block some dazzling light and leave soft light in the room. It would be your good choice to have a good relaxing in the blind. There are brown, white, beige and gray, totally 4 colors for choosing. Don't hesitate to buy one now! FEATURE: 22\"x60\" Semi-shut Roller Blind Sunscreen Roller Blinds You can see through these blinds Aluminium Top tube, PVC Bottom Bar Smooth operation  Low maintenance Suitable for any room Elegant and clean Simple structure, easy to assemble","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51UiVr07aHL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Giantex","source_asin":"B071W8JSCG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-919915","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B071W8JSCG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B071W8JSCG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":919916,"name":"Sage Cutting Board, 10-1/2 by 16-Inch, Natural","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81N8X8dLKbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Sage brand was born with a single idea: to offer every home gourmet cook the same quality cutting boards and cook tools preferred by the best professional chefs in the world. Sage smart culinary surfaces and Sage cook tools are made from the same premium material used in restaurant and food service kitchens. All Sage products are FSC certified, making Sage an environmentally conscious choice You can feel good about purchasing and using every day. All Sage products are manufactured in the USA in Seattle, WA, by established food industry leader read products, Inc. (The leader in durable food preparation surfaces for the commercial food service industry for over 50 years). Sage surfaces are knife friendly and will withstand heat to 350 degrees F when used as a trivet. Sage/read products does more than offer a sustainable product, they also donate one percent of the gross sales of Sage Smart culinary surfaces and Sage cook tools to 1% for the planet. Read’s contributions are specifically earmarked for planting new trees. Many other factors contribute toward making a Product Green. For instance, read products sources raw materials from within a 30-mile radius of its Seattle, Washington location. Any waste generated in manufacturing stays very close to where it originates. Sawdust is taken to a local composting plant. Material too small for cutting surfaces is used to make even smaller products for other industries, so very little actually ends up in the landfill. Sage/read maintains a company goal to implement ideas that will reduce their carbon footprint, improving the integrity of the products they manufacture. Warranted to last a lifetime.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81N8X8dLKbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sage","source_asin":"B003P0VWZ4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-919916","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B003P0VWZ4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B003P0VWZ4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
