window.products.push({"id":919998,"name":"Joyoldelf Stainless Steel Rice Washing Bowl, Versatile 3-In-1 Colander and Kitchen Strainer with Side Drainers for Rice, Vegetables & Fruit","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/710t0MtO4LL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"A Must Have for Any Kitchen - Pasta strainer is ideal to be used for all kinds of food like rice, grapes, cherries, legumes, grains, mung bean, pasta, barley, spaghetti, etc. Also colander/strainer can be used for draining, straining, washing and storing, actually kitchen strainer is a perfect addition for modern kitchen. Easy and Safe to Use - Strainer comes with evenly fine drainage holes at the side of strainer, strainers for kitchen offers fast draining and keeps rice, vegetables and fruits in the food strainer at the same time. Unique Slanted Design with Side Drainers - Food strainer has a unique slanted design at the bottom of colander, causes water or other liquid flows out quickly and easily, the side drainers allow to effectively and thoroughly wash rice before cooking. Super Easy to Clean - Metal strainer is mirror polished, that means cleaning is so easy, just rinsing over sink strainer under running water, also dishwasher safe. Noodle strainer is an ideal gift for family and friends due to the perfect combination of practicality and art design. Food Grade & Heavy Duty Stainless Steel - In order to offer solid construction and high quality kitchen colander, stainless steel strainer is constructed of thickened food grade stainless steel with a mirror-polished surface, harmless to food, corrosion resistant and durable, has longer service life.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/710t0MtO4LL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Joyoldelf","source_asin":"B09YTY3NXS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-919998","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09YTY3NXS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09YTY3NXS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":919999,"name":"PURPLEBIRD 11 Inch Brisket Knife,Slicing Carving Knife for Meat Cutting Hand Forged Ultra Sharp Meat Slicer Wood Handle for BBQ Grilling Roast with Gi","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":35.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71P6dWmmFlL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Long Knife-This 11\" blade slicing knife is long enough as brisket Knife. Most desirable length by professionals, allowing for those thin, angled cuts. Unique Blade- The hammered texture on the blade creates pockets of air, which prevent food from sticking to the blade and creates less friction. The ultra sharp knife makes easy work of creating slices of meat without tearing or shredding. Ergonomic Design-You will be amazed by the comfortable grip of this carving knife,just the right heft and balance. The wood handle is polished smooth with brass decoration make this meat knife is a piece of art. Widely Used-This long thin knife works well with different types of meat like brisket, turkey, ham, smoked salmon and roast. It can also be used to slice big fruits like watermelon and vegetables. PURPLEBIRD - Each of our Slicing Knives has to pass a strict quality control before shipping. The knife is carefully packed in an elegant black box. Perfect as a gift for someone you care about.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71P6dWmmFlL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PURPLEBIRD","source_asin":"B0BTHXKVDR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-919999","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BTHXKVDR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BTHXKVDR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
